    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I&#39;m trying to get the <a href=\"http://unpaywall.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://unpaywall.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390135731000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3D1wVoynNBNW-ZOgzRCx9c\">Unpaywall</a> browser extension to <a href=\"https://github.com/Impactstory/unpaywall/blob/master/extension/unpaywall.js#L446\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Impactstory/unpaywall/blob/master/extension/unpaywall.js%23L446&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390135731000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Qv13Roowz_Vkm2ycuxkIY\">read a meta tag</a> from within the app. The tag is added to DOM when the user filters one row from a DT table. <br><br>Is there a way to pass this reactive meta tag info to the browser?<br><br>Some demo data articles.csv:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Article&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;DOI&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;First&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;doi:10.1039/C4CP02345G&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Second&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;doi:10.1039/C4CP02175G&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Third&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;doi:10.1039/C4CP02325G&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span></div></code></div><br>global.R:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">table</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;articles.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> header </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;,&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stringsAsFactors </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> F</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br>server.R:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  output$x1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  output$addtag </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#000\"></span><br><span style=\"color:#000\"><code><span>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># From example <a href=\"https://yihui.shinyapps.io/DT-info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://yihui.shinyapps.io/DT-info/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390135731000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0C7eIhfJHOemQn6ppxq83Z\">https://yihui.shinyapps.io/DT-info/</a></span><span><br></span></code>    t1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$x1_rows_current<br>    <br>    tt </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">null</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">||</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> t1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Nothing&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">t1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;DOI&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    tags$meta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;doi&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>ui.R:<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  title </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;DataTable on articles&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;addtag&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  h1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Table&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;x1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> plotOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;x2&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> height </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">500</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><br></div>"
    ]
